<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Atlas College - Online Academic Application Process</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #0056b3;
            --primary-hover: #004085;
            --primary-light: #e7f1ff;
            --bg-color: #ffffff;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #333333;
            --text-muted: #555555;
            --border-color: #d1d8e0;
            --danger: #d9534f;
            --transition-speed: 0.3s ease;
            --page-padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 60px);
        }
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        html {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100%;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }
        body {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        button, input, select {
            font: inherit;
        }
        a {
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }
        .page {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            flex: 1;
        }
        .page-content {
            width: 100%;
            padding-left: var(--page-padding);
            padding-right: var(--page-padding);
        }
        .site-header {
            width: 100%;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .site-header-inner {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 74px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 12px var(--page-padding);
        }
        .logo-area {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .brand-logo {
            width: 132px;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }
        .menu-button {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: #444;
            transition: 0.2s ease;
        }
        .menu-button:hover {
            background: var(--primary-light);
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
        }
        .menu-icon {
            width: 22px;
            height: 16px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .menu-icon span {
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background: #444;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        .welcome-section {
            width: 100%;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .welcome-inner {
            width: 100%;
            padding-top: clamp(12px, 2vw, 25px);
            padding-bottom: clamp(28px, 4vw, 55px);
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .welcome-section h1 {
            color: #173d70;
            font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .welcome-section h2 {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.55rem);
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .welcome-intro {
            max-width: 1100px;
            color: #44566c;
            font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.2vw, 1rem);
        }
        .process-grid {
            width: 100%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: clamp(15px, 2vw, 30px);
            margin-top: 22px;
        }
        .process-column {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .process-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            color: #42546a;
            font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 1vw, 0.98rem);
        }
        .process-number {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 27px;
            height: 27px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .help-bar {
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 15px clamp(15px, 2vw, 25px);
            border: 1px solid #b8daff;
            background: #e7f1ff;
            border-radius: 7px;
            color: #004085;
        }
        .help-bar strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }
        .application-section {
            width: 100%;
            padding-top: clamp(20px, 3vw, 40px);
            padding-bottom: clamp(30px, 5vw, 70px);
        }
        .card {
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 9px;
            padding: clamp(18px, 2.5vw, 32px);
            margin-bottom: clamp(16px, 2vw, 25px);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 7px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.035);
            transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
        }
        .card:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }
        .question-row {
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.2vw, 1rem);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .question-row label {
            flex: 1 1 300px;
        }
        .question-row select {
            min-width: 190px;
            padding: 10px 13px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: white;
            color: var(--text-main);
            cursor: pointer;
            outline: none;
        }
        .question-row select:focus {
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 86, 179, 0.1);
        }
        /* Style for closed/unavailable dropdown options */
        option.disabled-option {
            color: #b0b8c1 !important;
            background-color: #f8f9fa !important;
            filter: blur(0.3px);
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .required-star {
            color: var(--danger);
        }
        .form-title {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.35rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .form-description {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 1vw, 0.95rem);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .form-group {
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: clamp(0.82rem, 1vw, 0.92rem);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
        }
        .form-control {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 46px;
            padding: 11px 13px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 1vw, 0.96rem);
            outline: none;
        }
        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 86, 179, 0.1);
        }
        .or-divider {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 10px 0 20px;
            color: #777;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .or-divider::before,
        .or-divider::after {
            content: "";
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--border-color);
        }
        .popia-box {
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            background: #fafbfc;
            padding: clamp(15px, 2vw, 25px);
            border-radius: 5px;
            height: clamp(180px, 25vw, 300px);
            overflow-y: auto;
            font-size: clamp(0.82rem, 1vw, 0.92rem);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .popia-box p {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .consent-title {
            font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 1vw, 0.96rem);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .radio-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .radio-option {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 7px 0;
        }
        .radio-option input {
            width: 17px;
            height: 17px;
            accent-color: var(--primary-color);
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .portal-alert {
            background: #e7f1ff;
            border: 1px solid #b8daff;
            padding: clamp(16px, 2vw, 25px);
            border-radius: 7px;
            color: #004085;
            font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 1vw, 0.98rem);
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .portal-alert a {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .submit-btn {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 46px;
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 11px 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
        }
        .submit-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-hover);
        }
        .submit-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.99);
        }
        .hidden {
            display: none !important;
        }
        .fade-in {
            animation: fadeIn var(--transition-speed) forwards;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-7px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }
        .footer {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 100%;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 24px 25px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .footer-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            flex: 0 0 auto;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #708aa8;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .footer-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 32px;
        }
        .footer-right a {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #708aa8;
            font-weight: 500;
            pointer-events: none;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .footer-right a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .footer {
                padding: 20px 18px;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 16px;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }
            .footer-right {
                gap: 20px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .process-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .question-row {
                align-items: stretch;
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .question-row label {
                flex: none;
            }
            .question-row select {
                width: 100%;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            .radio-group {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 4px;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            :root {
                --page-padding: 14px;
            }
            .site-header-inner {
                min-height: 62px;
            }
            .menu-button {
                width: 40px;
                height: 40px;
            }
            .welcome-inner {
                padding-top: 10px;
                padding-bottom: 25px;
            }
            .card {
                padding: 17px;
                border-radius: 7px;
            }
            .popia-box {
                height: 220px;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 350px) {
            :root {
                --page-padding: 10px;
            }
            .process-item {
                gap: 8px;
            }
            .process-number {
                width: 24px;
                height: 24px;
                font-size: 0.7rem;
            }
            .card {
                padding: 14px;
            }
            .submit-btn {
                font-size: 0.86rem;
            }
        }
        @media (min-width: 1600px) {
            :root {
                --page-padding: 5vw;
            }
            .welcome-inner,
            .application-section {
                padding-top: 25px;
                padding-bottom: 65px;
            }
        }
        @media (min-width: 1150px) {
            .page {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
                grid-template-rows: auto auto;
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 100%;
                overflow-x: hidden;
            }
            .site-header {
                grid-column: 1 / -1;
                grid-row: 1;
                width: 100%;
            }
            .welcome-section {
                grid-column: 1;
                grid-row: 2;
                width: 100%;
                min-width: 0;
                border-bottom: none;
                border-right: 1px solid transparent;
                min-height: calc(100vh - 74px);
            }
            .welcome-inner {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                padding-top: 25px;
                padding-bottom: 25px;
            }
            .application-section {
                grid-column: 2;
                grid-row: 2;
                width: 100%;
                min-width: 0;
                padding-top: 18px;
                padding-bottom: 30px;
            }
            .application-section .page-content {
                width: 100%;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            .application-section .card {
                width: 100%;
            }
            .process-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 10px;
            }
            .process-column {
                gap: 10px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
    <header class="site-header">
        <div class="site-header-inner">
            <div class="logo-area">
                <a href="#" aria-label="myAtlas home" class="logo-link" onclick="return false;">
                    <img class="brand-logo" src="assets/logos.png" alt="myAtlas College">
                </a>
            </div>
            <button
                class="menu-button"
                aria-label="Open menu"
                type="button"
            >
                <div class="menu-icon">
                    <span></span>
                    <span></span>
                    <span></span>
                </div>
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>
    <section class="welcome-section">
        <div class="page-content welcome-inner">
            <h2>
                Online Academic Application Process
            </h2>
            <p class="welcome-intro">
                To ensure a smooth and successful application, please
                follow the steps below. You will need to provide accurate
                and complete information and have your identification
                documents and academic records ready before you begin.
            </p>
            <div class="process-grid">
                <div class="process-column">
                    <div class="process-item">
                        <span class="process-number">1</span>
                        <span>
                            Complete the online application form.
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                        <span class="process-number">2</span>
                        <span>
                            Provide the required supporting documents.
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                        <span class="process-number">3</span>
                        <span>
                            Pay the application fee, if applicable.
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-column">
                    <div class="process-item">
                        <span class="process-number">4</span>
                        <span>
                            Wait for your application to be reviewed.
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                        <span class="process-number">5</span>
                        <span>
                            Receive your admission decision via email.
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                        <span class="process-number">6</span>
                        <span>
                            Follow the next steps to register and enrol.
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-bar">
                <strong>
                    Need help?
                </strong>
                <span>
                    If you experience any difficulties, please contact
                    our admissions office for assistance.
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <main class="application-section">
        <div class="page-content">
            <div class="card" id="program-select-card">
                <div class="question-row">
                    <label for="program-wish-select">
                        What do you wish to apply for?
                    </label>
                    <select id="program-wish-select">
                        <option value="">
                            --- Select option ---
                        </option>
                        <option value="Undergraduate Degree">
                            Undergraduate degree
                        </option>
                        <option value="Postgraduate Degree">
                            Postgraduate degree
                        </option>
                        <option value="Research Degree">
                            Master's & Doctoral degree
                        </option>
                    </select>
                    <span class="required-star">
                        *
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div
                class="card hidden fade-in"
                id="step1-card"
            >
                <div class="question-row">
                    <label for="student-number-select">
                        Do you already have a student number?
                    </label>
                    <select id="student-number-select">
                        <option value="">
                            --- Please select ---
                        </option>
                        <option value="yes">
                            Yes
                        </option>
                        <option value="no">
                            No
                        </option>
                    </select>
                    <span class="required-star">
                        *
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div
                class="card hidden fade-in"
                id="portal-redirect-card"
            >
                <div class="portal-alert">
                    <strong>
                        Welcome back.
                    </strong>
                    <br>
                    You already have a student number.
                    Please proceed to log into your online
                    student application portal using your
                    student number and PIN.
                    <br><br>
                    Click
                    <a href="#ienabler-portal">
                        here
                    </a>
                    to access your myAtlas portal.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div
                class="card hidden fade-in"
                id="step2-card"
            >
                <div class="question-row">
                    <label for="returning-select">
                        Are you returning to complete an application?
                    </label>
                    <select id="returning-select">
                        <option value="">
                            --- Please select ---
                        </option>
                        <option value="yes">
                            Yes
                        </option>
                        <option value="no">
                            No
                        </option>
                    </select>
                    <span class="required-star">
                        *
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div
                class="card hidden fade-in"
                id="step3-card"
            >
                <div class="form-title">
                    Find Your Application
                </div>
                <div class="form-description">
                    Please enter the identification details
                    you used when starting your application.
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="sa-id">
                        South African ID Number
                    </label>
                    <input
                        type="text"
                        id="sa-id"
                        class="form-control"
                        placeholder="Enter your ID number"
                    >
                </div>
                <div class="or-divider">
                    OR
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="passport">
                        Passport Number
                        (if no ID number)
                    </label>
                    <input
                        type="text"
                        id="passport"
                        class="form-control"
                        placeholder="Enter your passport number"
                    >
                </div>
                <button
                    class="submit-btn"
                    id="find-app-btn"
                    type="button"
                >
                    Find My Application ➔
                </button>
            </div>
            <div
                class="card hidden fade-in"
                id="step4-card"
            >
                <div class="form-title">
                    POPIA – Privacy Notice
                </div>
                <div class="form-description">
                    Please read the privacy notice below before
                    continuing with your application.
                </div>
                <div class="popia-box">
                    <p>
                        <strong>
                            POPIA Privacy Notice
                        </strong>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>
                            1. Introduction
                        </strong>
                        <br>
                        Atlas College is committed to protecting
                        your personal information in accordance
                        with the Protection of Personal Information
                        Act (POPIA).
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        This notice explains how we collect, use,
                        store and protect your personal information
                        when you apply to study at our college.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>
                            2. Information We Collect
                        </strong>
                        <br>
                        We may collect personal details including
                        your name, identity number, passport number,
                        contact details, academic history and
                        supporting documentation.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>
                            3. Purpose of Collection
                        </strong>
                        <br>
                        Personal information is collected for the
                        purpose of processing your application,
                        communicating with you regarding your
                        application, maintaining student records
                        and fulfilling applicable legal and
                        regulatory requirements.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>
                            4. Protection of Information
                        </strong>
                        <br>
                        Atlas College takes reasonable measures
                        to protect personal information against
                        unauthorised access, loss, misuse,
                        alteration or disclosure.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>
                            5. Applicant Rights
                        </strong>
                        <br>
                        Applicants may have rights relating to
                        access to, correction of and protection
                        of their personal information as provided
                        for under applicable legislation.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>
                            6. Contact
                        </strong>
                        <br>
                        If you have questions regarding the
                        processing of your personal information,
                        please contact the Atlas College
                        admissions office.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="consent-title">
                    <strong>
                        Consent & Agreement
                    </strong>
                    <br>
                    Please select one of the options below
                    to continue.
                </div>
                <div class="radio-group">
                    <label class="radio-option">
                        <input
                            type="radio"
                            name="popia_consent"
                            value="accept"
                        >
                        <span>
                            I accept
                        </span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="radio-option">
                        <input
                            type="radio"
                            name="popia_consent"
                            value="decline"
                        >
                        <span>
                            I do not accept
                        </span>
                    </label>
                </div>
                <button
                    class="submit-btn"
                    id="popia-continue-btn"
                    type="button"
                >
                    NEXT ➔
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-left">
            &copy; 2026 Atlas College. All rights reserved.
        </div>
        <div class="footer-right">
            <a href="#" onclick="return false;" id="privacyLink">Privacy Policy</a>
            <a href="#" onclick="return false;" id="termsLink">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>
            <a href="#" onclick="return false;" id="supportLink">Help</a>
        </div>
    </footer>
</div>
<script type="module" src="apply.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
